<title>NORWAY: TENNIS-NORWAY BEAT NIGERIA 5-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-NORWAY BEAT NIGERIA 5-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-05-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway completed a 5-0 win over Nigeria after victory in both reverse singles in their Davis Cup Euro/African zone group two, first round tie on Sunday.</p>
<p>Results: Christian Ruud beat Ganiyu Adelekan 6-0 6-0 Thomas Heyerdahl beat Sule Ladipo 7-5 6-3</p>
